{"sba-keyaki-12978":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんにちは!\n \n 日曜お昼\n 皆さんいかがお過ごしですか?\n \n 佐藤詩織です!\n \n \n \n \n 12月と思えないくらいポカポカしたり\n かと思えば夜は冷え込んだり\n \n 気候が忙しいですが\n 皆さん体調崩してないですか?🙃\n \n 暖かいとついつい街に\n 出かけたくなっちゃいますよね\n \n わたしインドア派だから\n ちゃんとこれからは\n 外に出ようと思います\n \n \n \n \n \n \n よいしょー👍🏻\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJRSEQS1YQ2MX5YDXCVYH1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ダンスも歌ももっと上手くなりたい\n \n ダンスも歌も最高にできたら\n もっともっとLIVEとか最高に\n 楽しいのだろうなと、最近🙏🏻\n \n アイドルをする期間って この瞬間って\n 多分人生の何十年かにしたら\n ほんのひと時かもしれない\n \n だけど、だからこそ\n この瞬間を最高にやり抜きたいなって\n \n \n だからとりあえずダンスと歌\n めちゃくちゃ上手くなりたいガンバる\n \n \n 最近よくふーちゃんとも話してました\n こんな話\n \n \n 皆さんまだまだ沢山の応援\n よろしくお願いしますね🙇🏻🙏🏻\n \n 皆さんがずっと、離れないように\n 応援したいって思ってもらえるよう\n もっともっと上を目指します🔥\n \n \n \n \n \n \n ではでは\n またねみんな😎🎵\n \n 詩織**"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-39016":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n 昨日発売の\n ananは『夏新色』がテーマです🍉💄\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1H6QF1TQ7S60FF1603X1C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 果たしてどんな\n かわいい夏コスメが出てくるのか\n 是非❤\n 本誌でチェックしてみてください🥺👏🏻\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1H7XTRV35EE3VB8PGJG7W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n こんな色味のアイライナーにもチャレンジしておりまする✊🏻💫\n \n \n マスカラ無しでも\n アイシャドウやラインの使い方次第で目を印象深く作れるのです🥺🥺🥺スゴい❣️\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1H95DSS5E1R2N9FSR5D7K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n     \n \n \n \n みなさん\n 雨に濡れずちゃんと帰ってこれましたか〜？\n はやくお体温めてゆっくりお休み下さいね\n \n \n 今日もお疲れ様でした☺️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1HA5E0GZY5AHKRSV3J7DD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n おやすみなさい✨😴🧖‍♀️💤💫             "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-39709":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n \n \n こんばんは！\n \n \n \n \n \n 遅ればせながら\n ノンノ50周年おめでとうございます💐\n \n 歴史ある雑誌に出させていただけていることがとても嬉しいです。\n \n 50周年を記念してアドボードも今月の17日まで掲出されているみたいなので、\n お時間ある方は見に行ってみてくださいね☺️\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして、発売中のノンノ7月号より\n わたしの連載 \"りさいず\" がスタートしています！\n \n いつかはできたらいいな、と思っていた連載が\n 読者の皆さまのおかげで任せていただくことができて本当にありがたいです。\n \n \n 連載を通して、色々なわたしをお届けできるよう頑張りますので 毎月お楽しみにしていてくださいね🌵\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1TDT3DKBBBW11TVSH0Y21","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n よろしくお願いします☺️\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n またね\n \n \n 渡邉理佐             "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-23111":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名どおり結論から言えば\n二日間私はおうちに帰らなかったです。"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-01@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(๑́•∀•๑̀)ฅﾃﾍ-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日目は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山一実"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢漢字あってるよね？｣"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野七瀬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの四人で仕事終わりご飯食べに行ってそのまま七瀬ちゃん家に泊まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃん家のまあやのフェイバリットゾーンはＴＶの向かい側にあるソファーです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パジャマとか何も持っていかなかったので次の日の服も全部用意してくれました‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前からお泊りおいで～って言ってくてれたので行けて嬉しい～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ƭʜᵃℕҡ ყօϋ୨୧ᐝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-07@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝まあやの方が先に仕事で出ちゃうんだけど、\n起こさないように準備して出るときだけ行ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-08@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ったらわざわざ眠たい目を擦りながら起きてお見送りしてくれたの～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-09@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-10@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして次の日の仕事が終わったら\nまた同じメンバーで次はかずみん家に行きました..."},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-11@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出前とか頼んでまったりこたつでくつろぎました(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡\nかずみんが昨日の残りのお鍋食べる？って言ってくれていただきました～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-13@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-13@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-13@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味しみてて美味しかったなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"(๑´ㅂ`๑)ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\"ŧ‹\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこんなでとっても楽しい二日間を過ごしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二日間帰らないのはちょっと不良になったちゃったなぁ...っと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-16@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも遊んでくれた愛未ちゃん、かずみん、なぁちゃんありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-09@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しわわせいっぱい(*˘︶˘*).｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんと～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッション誌CUTiEに出させて頂きます～"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-05@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉し～‼️\n是非チェックしてね～\n=͟͟͞͞=͟͟͞͞=͟͟͞͞=͟͟͞͞))ु˃̶͈̀ω˂̶͈́ )੭ु⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして11日はお父さんの大切な誕生日でもあり\n東北大震災の日ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も明後日も皆が笑顔で幸せでありますように\n自分に何ができるのか考えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、7５５に関してですが、\n春休み入ったらやろうと思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援やアドバイス‥心配してもらえて‥\nありがとうチャレンジしてみるね\nもし良かったらチェックしてくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:A6F2C23059647B50E3C22B8B6D87EFBB-21@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月３日握手会が完売したよ～！ってコメント見てビックリ‼︎皆、本当にありがとうございます‼️\n沢山のメンバーの中で、まあやに会いに来てくれて‥ありがとう    嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなっちゃったけど、birthdayLIVEの時も\nお花をありがとうございました。❤️❤️\n写真撮れなかったのが残念でしかたない‥涙\n誰か撮ってないかな～‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ⓗ⃞ⓐ⃞ⓟ⃞ⓟ⃞ⓨ⃞ ᵕ̈*Ⓑ⃞ⓘ⃞ⓡ⃞ⓣ⃞ⓗ⃞ⓓ⃞ⓐ⃞ⓨ⃞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢は大人なのにお顔は赤ちゃんだね\nまあやはまりっかのこと携帯にオッさん！って入れてるよ 笑\nだって食べ物とかおつまみ好きでしょ⁉︎\nだからだよ～笑\nオッさんの名前は変える事は多分ないよっ\nでもね、オシャレで可愛いまりっか大スキなんだぁ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直あーちゃんが同級生には思えません。だってお顔がベビーフェイスなんだもん\n最近ショートの仲間入りして仲間増えてうれちぃ秋田から通ってるの大変だと思うけど頑張ってねまあやも広島から通ってた時期があったからなんでも相談してねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本奈々未"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんはまあやと味覚も体の柔らかい所硬い所、ホクロの位置、骨格が似てるねってよく話します。沢山似てるね所があってうれしいよーまた物理とか数学教えてちょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３人ともだぁ～～いスキ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/03/11/8292359/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返ししてなかったのと、誕生日のお祝いします*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.397 かほたろす さんへ\n5年間部活お疲れ様でした。素敵な後輩さんだね～(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.341 包帯男 さんへ\n負けたくないのは‥自分‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＮＯ.214 のひ さんへ\n2